+# Commands the settings assistant may propose (Settings > Assistant).
+# Settings themselves (crosshairsize 30, gamma 110...) need nothing here:
+# any setting of the menus or saved in config.cfg is already allowed, inside
+# its own limits. This file lists the other commands.
+#
+#   cmd NAME ARGS | what it does | extra search words
+#   action NAME ARGS | what it does | extra search words
+#
+# "action" = only allowed as what a key does (bind KEY action).
+# ARGS: KEY (key name), ACTION (one allowed command or action), INT, NUM,
+# WORD, TEXT, PAGE (a settings page); "?" = optional.
+#
+#   keyscript NAME | exact script | what it does | extra search words
+#
+# "keyscript" = a key action of the Keys page written as a small script: the
+# assistant only writes NAME (bind V togglethirdperson) and the game binds the
+# exact script given here, the same text as the Keys page (so the page shows the
+# key). The game refuses a script that names quit, exec, alias, say, connect...
+# Whatever this file says, the game never lets the assistant run quit,
+# connect, exec, alias, say, writecfg and the like, nor any script.
+# /assistantreload re-reads this file.
+
+cmd bind KEY ACTION | put an action on a key (while playing) | touche touches clavier bouton assigner raccourci key keys shortcut
+cmd specbind KEY ACTION | put an action on a key (while spectating) | touche spectateur spec clavier
+cmd editbind KEY ACTION | put an action on a key in edit mode only (the edit keys of the Keys page) | touche edition editer clavier
+cmd showgui PAGE | open a settings page | ouvrir menu page afficher
+cmd cyclemycolor | change my own name colour to the next one | couleur nom pseudo
+cmd settrailcolor WORD WORD WORD? | set a weapon trail colour: optional me / others / all (default all), then SG CG RL RI GL PI, then the colour as 6 hex digits (FF69B4 or #FF69B4), stock, or same (same as All) | trainee traine couleur arme fusil rifle tir moi autres
+cmd trailcolorreset WORD? | put the weapon trail colours back to stock: all of them, or only me / others / all | trainee traine couleur defaut reinitialiser
+cmd mixreset | put all sound mix sliders back to default | son mix defaut reinitialiser
+cmd clearconsole | empty the console | console effacer vider
+cmd GFX_profapply INT | RT profile (Graphics > Performance), sets every row: 0 Ultra (default, best); 1 High (same look, +10-20% fps: DLSS CNN, solid leaves, light NRD, still models); 2 Medium (+half sky, 3 lamps, adaptive rays, 1 soft ray); 3 Low (+2 lamps, 1 glow, no soft shadows: darker, fastest); 4 = Custom (rows changed by hand) | profil ultra haut high moyen medium bas low qualite rapide fps images seconde lent saccade fluide carte graphique gpu modeste faible petite performance image complete personnalise custom prereglage | now: GFX_profwhich
+cmd hudedit | open the HUD editor: every part of the HUD gets a frame the player drags with the mouse (right click puts one back, Esc when done) | hud deplacer placer disposition glisser bouger interface ecran position
+cmd hudlayoutreset | put every HUD part back in its original place | hud reinitialiser remettre position origine
+cmd importsettingsmenu | open the page that imports keys, name, options, servers and friends from another client (Sauerbraten, p1xbraten, an older L4ZY client or any folder); the import itself is only done by the player | importer import reglages parametres ancien client sauerbraten vanilla recuperer copier reprendre touches perdus
+
+action forward | move forward | avancer avant deplacement
+action backward | move backward | reculer arriere deplacement
+action left | strafe left | gauche deplacement
+action right | strafe right | droite deplacement
+action jump | jump | sauter saut
+action attack | shoot | tirer tir feu
+action togglezoom | zoom in/out (rifle scope) | zoom viser lunette
+action saycommand TEXT? | open the chat line to type a message, optionally with text already typed: "/" = the command line, "/tsay " = say translated, "/tsayteam " = team say translated, "/tsayr " / "/tsayteamr " = careful translation, "/trep " / "/trepteam " = reply in the language of the last chat line | chat ecrire message parler commande traduire traduction repondre
+action sayteamcommand | open the team chat | chat equipe message
+action showscores | show the scoreboard while held | tableau scores classement
+action toggleconsole | open/close the full console | console
+action togglechat | open/close the full chat | chat historique
+action togglekilllog | open/close the full kill list | killfeed frags liste
+action toggletranslate | turn chat translation on/off | traduction traduire
+action tretry | translate the last message again | traduction retraduire
+action togglematchrecord | start/stop the match video recording | video enregistrement
+action toggledemorecord | start/stop the demo recording | demo enregistrement
+action screenshot | take a screenshot | capture ecran photo
+action setweapon WORD | choose a weapon: FI chainsaw, SG shotgun, CG chaingun, RL rockets, RI rifle, GL grenades, PI pistol | arme armes fusil roquette grenade pistolet tronconneuse
+action weapon | switch to the best weapon that has ammo (chaingun, rockets, shotgun, rifle, grenades, pistol, then chainsaw) | meilleure arme changer munitions
+action nextweapon INT? | next (1) or previous (-1) weapon | arme suivante precedente molette
+action dropflag | drop the flag (ctf) | drapeau lacher
+action taunt | taunt | provoquer
+action edittoggle | switch edit mode | edition editer carte
+action follow | follow a player (spectator) | suivre spectateur
+action nextfollow INT? | follow the next (1) or previous (-1) player | suivre suivant spectateur
+action universaldelta INT | mouse wheel action: 1 up, -1 down (while playing: next / previous weapon in wheel order; in edit mode: the edit tools) | molette roulette arme
+action suicide | kill yourself (you respawn) | suicide mourir tuer
+action togglemainmenu | open / close the main menu (Esc by default) | menu principal echap
+action addbot INT? WORD? | add a bot (local game, or as master); optional skill 1-101; optional style classic or tinyapa (on an L4ZY server a tinyapa bot stays Tiny Apa whoever's game runs it; elsewhere it follows bots play). Also on the Master page: Add bot: Classic / Tiny Apa | bot ajouter tiny apa classique style
+action delbot | remove a bot | bot retirer supprimer
+action conskip INT | scroll the console (or the expanded chat F10 / the kill list F8 while open): 5 = back, -1000 = to the newest line | console defiler remonter historique
+action spectator INT | 1 = become a spectator, 0 = join the game again | spectateur regarder rejoindre
+action paused INT | 1 = pause, 0 = resume (local games and demos, or as master) | pause
+action demorewind INT? | while watching a demo: go back, in milliseconds (default 10000 = 10 s) | demo reculer retour arriere
+action demoforward INT? | while watching a demo: go ahead, in milliseconds (default 10000 = 10 s) | demo avancer
+action toggledemohd | while watching a demo: switch between the exact HD aim and the vanilla aim | demo hd visee
+action toggledemobar | while watching a demo: hide or show the demo controls and the player list, to watch or film the demo cleanly | demo cacher masquer barre controles filmer
+action toggledemoxray | while watching a demo played on this computer: show every player through the walls in their colour, or not (also the X-RAY button of the demo bar) | demo rayons x xray travers murs silhouettes
+action allowspedit | hold it to enter edit mode in single player modes (Ctrl by default) | edition editer solo ctrl
+action editcopy | edit mode: copy the selection | edition copier
+action editpaste | edit mode: paste | edition coller
+action undo | edit mode: undo | edition annuler
+action redo | edit mode: redo | edition refaire retablir
+action editdel | edit mode: delete the selection | edition supprimer effacer
+action editflip | edit mode: flip the selection | edition retourner miroir
+action calclight | edit mode: compute the classic lighting of the map | edition lumiere calcul eclairage
+
+keyscript togglethirdperson | if (allowthirdperson) [togglevar thirdperson] | third person view on / off (Keys page: Third person; works offline and in edit mode only) | troisieme 3e personne vue camera exterieure derriere third person view thirdperson tps
+keyscript togglespectator | spectator (! (isspectator (getclientnum))) | spectate on / off: become a spectator, press again to join the game (Keys page: Spectate on / off) | spectateur spectate observer regarder rejoindre spec
+keyscript togglepause | set paused (= $paused 0) | pause / resume the game (Keys page: Pause; local games and demos, or as master) | pause reprendre arreter
+keyscript saytranslated | saycommand "/tsay " | open the chat to say something translated into my send language (Keys page: Say translated) | dire traduit traduire traduction envoyer message tsay
+keyscript sayteamtranslated | saycommand "/tsayteam " | open the team chat, translated (Keys page: Team, translated) | equipe traduit traduire traduction tsayteam
+keyscript saycareful | saycommand "/tsayr " | open the chat for a careful translation, the model thinks first (Keys page: Say, careful) | traduction soignee reflechie precise tsayr
+keyscript sayteamcareful | saycommand "/tsayteamr " | open the team chat for a careful translation (Keys page: Team, careful) | equipe traduction soignee tsayteamr
+keyscript replytranslated | saycommand "/trep " | reply in the language of the last chat line (Keys page: Reply translated) | repondre reponse langue trep
+keyscript replyteamtranslated | saycommand "/trepteam " | team reply in the language of the last chat line (Keys page: Team, reply) | repondre reponse equipe trepteam
+keyscript commandline | saycommand / | open the command line (Keys page: Command line) | ligne de commande commande console slash
+keyscript editundo | undo; passthroughsel 0 | edit mode: undo, as on the Keys page (Keys page: Undo) | edition annuler
